thesis.tex 
--- pdflatex -src-
-src-specials	insert source specials into the output file, in certain places
--- xelatex -no-
-no-file-line-error 	disable file:line:error style messages
-no-mktex=	disable mktexFMT generation
-no-parse-first-line 	disable parsing of the first line of the input file
-no-pdf 	generate XDV (extended DVI) output rather than PDF
-no-shell-escape 	disable the write18 shell escape
--- xelatex -output-
-output-comment=	use STRING for the file comment instead of the date
-output-directory=	use existing DIR as the directory to write files in
-output-driver=	use CMD as the XDV-to-PDF driver instead of xdvipdfmx
